{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想清理相片庫又怕誤刪重要回憶，Photolean 可協助找出相似照片、模糊影像、舊截圖與大型影片，讓用戶快速檢視並決定保留或刪除，適合相片數量繁多、儲存空間緊張的 iPhone 用戶。此 App 現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-280.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>背景掃描清理相片</h2>\n<p>Photolean 會掃描相片庫，找出相似照片、模糊影像、舊截圖與大型影片，並按類別檢查。可並排比較相似相片與連拍，參考建議特點後自行選擇保留項目，刪除前須確認。iOS 26 或以上支援背景分析，影片可壓縮成較小副本再比較。分析在 iPhone 上進行，相片與影片不會上傳作分析。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-63.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-64.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-65.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-66.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-67.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Photolean: AI Photo Cleaner</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/photolean-ai-photo-cleaner/id6828237238?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T02:23:52.554895+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T01:58:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:26.708449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:26.345010+00:00","content_hash":"0235dc6c8b306ac71a4b7c06bd83dc4f445f0bb42d6785646fd546ed80621f5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}